# DebugKit

## Plugin semantics

DebugKit provides a development toolbar and panels for requests/SQL. It is a require-dev aid — not a production monitoring stack.

## Required behavior

- Apply only when `cakephp/debug_kit` ^5 is installed.
- Keep DebugKit out of production deployments.
- Use panels to diagnose N+1/history — then fix ownership in code.
- Do not invent Telescope/Debugbar Laravel APIs.

## Anti-patterns

- Enabling DebugKit in production
- Shipping debug panels as the only “APM”
